{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B420","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这里的咖啡工厂也被<R=CIA,la CIA>占领了……居然还被改成了毒品工厂。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=CIA,la CIA>","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING;JPN_DRUG_FACTORY_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"明明以前还以出产优质咖啡豆闻名……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"Cafetal Aroma Encantado……大概就是“迷人香气”咖啡园吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":"JPN_COFFEE_PLANTATION_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯。只要把雇佣兵赶出哥斯达黎加，我想总有一天这里还能重新生产咖啡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_SENTENCE_COMPLETED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"到那时候，我还想给Snake泡一杯这里产的咖啡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":"JPN_BREW_FOR_SNAKE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我很期待。作战结束后啜一口热咖啡……不错。……哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"JPN_OPERATION_AND_HOT_CUP_DETAILS_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"怎么了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"没什么……只是想起以前有个讨厌咖啡的熟人。是个英国人。他总说：“别喝那种泥水，喝红茶。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"JPN_ACQUAINTANCE_AND_QUOTE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"天啊！居然不懂咖啡有多好喝……那个人真可怜。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"JPN_PITY_TONE_PRIMARY"}]}